ncil White Paper. Present status and future strategy for medical research in Europe. Strasbourg: European Science Foundation; 2009. [ Google Scholar ] European Commission. Commission staff working document: a rationale for action. Brussels; 2010. (SEC 1161) [ Google Scholar ] Government resolution on the Health 2015 public health programme. http://pre20031103.stm.fi/english/eho/publicat/health2015/health2015.pdf UK Government. National Institute for Health Research. Best research for best health. Implementation plans. http://www.nihr.ac.uk/about/pages/about_implementation_plans.aspx UK Clinical Research Collaboration. Strengthening public health research in the UK. Report of the UK clinical research collaboration public health strategic planning group. London: UK Clinical Research Collaboration; 2008. [ Google Scholar ] GIS-IreSP (Groupement d''Intérêt Scientifique, Institut de Recherche en Santé Publique) http://www.iresp.net/ European Commission, Directorate General Health and Consumers. National Focal Points. http://ec.europa.eu/health/programme/docs/nfp_en.pdf European Commission. Network of National Contact Points (NCPs) http://cordis.europa.eu/fp7/ncp_en.html Remme JHF, Adam T, Becerra-Posada F, D''Arcangues C, Devlin M. et al. Defining research to improve health systems. PLoS Med. 2010;7:e1001000. doi: 10.1371/journal.pmed.1001000. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Mays N. Health Services Research Conference. Den Haag, the Netherlands; 2010. Linking health services research and policy in Europe. [ Google Scholar ] Chalmers I. From optimism to disillusion about commitment to transparency in the medico-industrial complex. J R Soc Med. pp. 337–341. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] McCarthy M. Who supports health research in Europe? Eur J Public Health. 2010;20(1):3–5. doi: 10.1093/eurpub/ckp222. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Research!America. 2009 investment in health research. http://www.researchamerica.org/uploads/health